                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "So, first of all, I speedrun this game. And, as a speedgame, it's not terrible. About half of the tracks are known to have unintended skips of some variety, and racing games generally make for pretty good speedgames anyway. The biggest downside from this perspective is the lack of a time trials mode - and thus, the extreme reliance on getting good RNG to get good times. But, even from a speedrunning perspective, [i]get the game on mobile instead[/i]. It's cheaper, and the controls are way better imo.\n\nAs a casual game, however, it's pretty middling. You can do much better with those 5 bucks of yours.",
